# Phone held sideways (DPR 3): the Daily challenge by touch, slides by keys, a hint, the pause sheet with the 3D board switched off (the flat board), Resume, a swipe on the flat board, the 3D board back on, Leave run.
# viewport 844x390@3
until 300 =Play
frames 150
touch Daily challenge
until 120 Objective
frames 60
key ArrowLeft 1
frames 4
key ArrowDown 1
frames 4
key ArrowRight 1
frames 4
key ArrowUp 1
frames 4
key ArrowLeft 1
frames 4
key ArrowDown 1
frames 4
touch =Hint
frames 20
save land-play
touch =Pause
until 60 Paused
frames 10
save land-pause
touch =3D board (WebGL)
frames 10
touch =Resume
frames 20
swipe 50% 40% 50% 85% 6
frames 20
save land-flat
expect Moves 7
key Escape 1
until 60 Paused
frames 10
touch =3D board (WebGL)
frames 5
touch =Leave run
until 60 Resume run
frames 10
